  Enable/Disable Skills                                                                         
  Only enabled skills are shown to the model. Available skills stay off until you select them.  
                                                                                                
  Type to search skills                                                                         
  >                                                                                             
› [x] superpowers-systematic-debugging (polish)            Find root causes before fixing bug…  
  [ ] superpowers-verification-before-completion (polish)  Verify completion before claiming …  
                                                                                                
  Press space or enter to toggle; esc to close
